Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜怎么着 克劳力叔叔 我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what, uncle Crowley? I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉在像草一样疯长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Amara's growing like a radioactive weed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在大吃灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}By stuffing her face with souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她的法力有我想的一半的强\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's half as powerful as I think she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要她站在我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want her on my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗有无限的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness is almost infinite power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是联系在一起的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bound, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝以前收拾过这东西一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}God kicked this thing's ass once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need your help, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要谁来帮忙应付黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help deal with the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了 恶魔石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, demon tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是上帝的书记官 他什么事都听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was God's scribe. He did hear about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,马德森警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Madsen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我之前看到附近有个人 - 那是伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw a guy hanging around earlier. - That's Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得阿玛拉吸食了他的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Amara sucked out his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会担下所有的凶案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll confess to all the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我就出不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, I can't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能杀他 他还没干过坏事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't kill him 'cause he hasn't done anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们也不想杀他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we don't…want to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是想救人的 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to save people, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你的新规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, your new rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能帮什么忙 - 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What can I do to help? - No, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐好 休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just, uh, sit there and take a breather,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看网飞什么的 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- watch some Netflix. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 我们还有更要紧的事要操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, we got bigger fish to fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.37,0:00:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 迪恩 回头见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Dean. I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:53.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说约会会让我无心顾及学业\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, she says dating's gonna break my focus for academics,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我暑假时可以约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that I'm allowed to date over summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要怎么做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that work? Like…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是歌蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Goldie,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只在六月到八月间可以恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only romantically available from June to August,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟我稳定下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but want to go steady?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨她 看我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate her. Like, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.02,0:01:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得跑来铁路边吃小零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to hang out by the tracks just to get my snack on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不许你吃薯片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't let you eat chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,允许是允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll let me, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她也是为了能一直摆出这副表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but just so she can make this face the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「抱歉了 老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like, "Sorry, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能像你那样光吃薄荷糖和无糖汽水「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't survive on menthol and diet soda like you can."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.74,0:01:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也恨我爸妈 歌蒂 他们最烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I hate my parents, too, Goldie. They suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得遵守宵禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got a curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.01,0:01:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.62,0:01:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 你需要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay? Do you want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.38,0:02:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,半夜去吃宵夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midnight snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我不知道你最近在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think I don't know what you've been up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以否认 但证据…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can try to deny it, but the evidence is…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,确凿\N{\fnArial\fs30}well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我别再吃你的恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me to stop feeding on your demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这不就不吃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… I stopped feeding on demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说得很清楚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样出去 被人看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going out there, where they can see you…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,太冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:02:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个长身体的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a growing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 行为是有后果的 阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actions have consequences around here, Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在宫里已经疯了一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had the run of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见识到你的作风了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen what you've made of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.66,0:03:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, this is going to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,会更加痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}way more than it hurts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被禁足了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但记住了 我更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you need to remember… I'm stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第6集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:54.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马萨诸塞州 福尔河）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还说觉得那个准没错呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said you had a good feeling about that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉是条好线索的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it seemed like a solid lead, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.81,0:04:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有没魂的变态才会杀了家里的宠物猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a soulless psycho would kill the family cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.15,0:04:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是宠物猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, unless the family cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己钻进烘干机里睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}decides to take a nap in the dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从周一就一直待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we've been here since Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没找到别的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and still haven't found another legit victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许阿玛拉去别处 或干脆停止进食了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Amara moved on or stopped feeding altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到被她吸魂的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… Finding her victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍是找到她的最佳机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}is still the best shot we got at finding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not actually true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.37,0:04:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你觉得他准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what? You think he's ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最近挺惨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had a pretty rough go of it lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of us hasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.77,0:04:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们唯一的天使朋友在家闲着太不合理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems insane to leave our one and only angel friend on the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}…It literally doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.05,0:04:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们稍后就公布所有结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're gonna get to all the results in just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们首先说说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna start with, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到我们的第一则报道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go back to our first story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯 希拉和埃德温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Louis, Silla, and Edwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你还好吗 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass. How you doing, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给路易斯做了DNA检测\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did a DNA test on Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.73,0:04:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到梅塔特隆的线索了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything on Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使无线电上没消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, nothing on angel radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.49,0:04:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多久没出过地堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long's it been since you left the bunker?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.14,0:04:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要离开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, why would I leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里什么都有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got everything I need right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Is that…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:04.48,Title,0,0,0,0,,你是在看《珍妮·琼斯秀》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you watching "Jenny Jones"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是重播\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rerun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚要宣布亲子鉴定结果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just about to announce the paternity results.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 他还没准备好做父亲呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny, he is not ready to be a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我以为你在连看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I-I-I thought you were going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,三观比较正的节目呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}with socially acceptable binge watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:21.06,Title,0,0,0,0,,《火线》《权力的游戏》什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know, "The wire, " "Game of thrones."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,人不能只吃鱼子酱啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, a man can't live on caviar alone, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听起来怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you sound weird, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好的那种怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也经历过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I've been down this road before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也听到过电视机里传出的海妖之歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard the siren's song from the idiot box,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 不管你想找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm telling you, whatever you're looking for,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不会在那儿找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't find it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电视关了 出去透口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off the TV. Go outside and get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这边什么情况都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the dark here, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你重回战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you back in the game, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.34,0:05:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢知会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, thanks for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll… we'll head out there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 马德森警探来电\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up? - That was Detective Madsen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.95,0:05:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我们那位朋友 伦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember our friend Len?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:05:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪咖 没魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, weird as hell, soulless,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,替罪羊伦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}took-the-rap-for-all-the-murders Len?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.41,0:06:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你 是咒语的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this isn't you. It's the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能克服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can beat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我灭了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will end you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.83,0:06:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you walk out of this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,马可昨晚处理掉一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marco got one of them last night…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦·弗莱彻\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Len Fletcher?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫马可接着找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Marco to keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最不需要的就是阿玛拉留下的糖纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing I need is one of Amara's candy wrappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟天使或猎人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}blabbing to angels or hunters about what,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们遭遇了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们人手最近有些不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, our ranks have been a bit thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为都被阿玛拉吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since Amara ate everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备了新数据 您上朝前可以看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got some fresh numbers for you to go over before court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂预测 不太理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soul projections… they're not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一季指标很低 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're down for the quarter, which means that…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那扇门应该全天候锁住守住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That door was supposed to be locked and guarded 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没有守卫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see a guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 肯定是搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, right. Must be a mix-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们缺人手嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're short-staffed and all, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 你被降职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. You've been demoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许任何人进出那个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one goes in or out of that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（监禁区 闲人免进）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,本以为是哪个伦杀害的人的亲属干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought maybe a relative of one of Len's victims,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但又不像是报复杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it doesn't feel like a revenge killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.20,0:08:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太干净了 简直像刺杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too clean, like an assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警探 - 失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Detective. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闻到了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You smell that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么那位警探需要改变饮食习惯 要么就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, either the detective needs to change his diet or, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,硫磺 是恶魔杀了伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur. Len was killed by a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔为什么要刺杀没魂的普通人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but why would a demon order a hit on a guy with no soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,空卖力没好处啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a Cracker Jack but not a prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.09,0:08:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我 废物警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands off, deputy doody!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.43,0:08:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌蒂·施密特拉普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldie Schmidtlapp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来挺正常 今早发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a normal kid, snapped this morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图用煎锅杀她妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}tried to kill her mom with a frying pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是斧子杀人案 然后是伦 又出这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}First the ax murders, then Len, now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得跟她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need to talk to the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,四条腿驾驭四个轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's four legs on four wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当自己是人的狗狗啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that dog thinks it's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:09:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 奥马哈州一则令人心痛的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up next, a very upsetting story out of Omaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚 市区一场酒吧殴斗升级酿成惨剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A downtown bar fight escalated tragically last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:06.05,Title,0,0,0,0,,《OWW2新闻》\N{\fnArial\fs30}And "OWW2 News"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,为您带来了事件的独家视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}brings you an exclusive video of the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将播放的视频十分血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The footage you're about to view is extremely graphic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:24.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（市区枪击案）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害者抢救无效…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Efforts were made to resuscitate the victim, but unfor…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官 我还没打上电话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, officer. I still haven't gotten my phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能叫个匹萨送进来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I could get a pizza delivered in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.23,0:10:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大的女儿最近在镇上到处闯祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss' daughter's been making a mess in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我得负责收拾残局\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's my job to clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别往心里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 歌蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Goldie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力和阿玛拉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Crowley and Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床啦 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Rise and shine, buttercup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于之前你说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…about what you were saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力跟阿玛拉在一起做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Crowley doing with Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know, don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是知道也不会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't tell you if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经知道她长得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we already know she's growing up fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 恶魔灵魂 对身体有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, demon souls… they do a body good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小东西把我半数的朋友都吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little muppet tore through half my buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力才开始让她节食\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Crowley put her on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不怎么高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就开始偷溜出去找吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started sneaking out to get her fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.84,0:11:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也知道孩子什么德行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how kids are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但爸爸毫不讲情面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But daddy put his foot down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把她藏哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he hiding her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乐意继续跟你们八卦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy to keep gossiping with you boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们想要有用情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you want actionable intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你折磨我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torture me if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你最后反正也会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'll just kill me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是陷入僵持了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks like a stalemate to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们这就杀了他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we go ahead and kill him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 迪恩 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Dean, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:12:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以给他驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can exorcise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,救他的肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save his meat suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}My two cents?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我驱魔 让我变烟离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You exorcise me, let me smoke on out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证不会告诉克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you my word not to tell Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在也不算是我最喜欢的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hardly my favorite guy at the moment. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.15,0:12:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, would you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的伤口 他的肉身肯定活不成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way his suit survived that wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:49.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（下载定位数据）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:55.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（歌蒂/阿玛拉 莉兹·波顿宅 酒吧/希德妮）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体丢哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you ditch the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 学校操场 - 别闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- School playground. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院停车场 有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hospital parking lot. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息 我黑了他的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, good news. I was able to hack his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了他呼叫记录的坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the coordinates of his call history.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力肯定是派他去跟踪阿玛拉还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess Crowley must've had him tailing Amara or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他三个地方都去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he was at all three spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉兹·波顿的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was at the Lizzie Borden house,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦是在那儿被吸了魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Len got his soul taken,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还去了希德妮被吸魂的酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was at the bar where Sydney got her soul taken,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.45,0:13:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌蒂说阿玛拉找上她的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Goldie said Amara approached her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么是在这个区域里 - 嗯 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, somewhere in there. - Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I don't get is,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力为什么要把阿玛拉安置在地球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would Crowley have Amara on earth in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.36,0:13:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她留在地狱里不是更明智吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't it be smarter to… to keep her in hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但那样他就得老在那儿待着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but then he'd have to spend more time there,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他讨厌那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he hates that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老是忘记你和克劳力的夏日恋情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep forgetting about you and Crowley's summer of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不出这范围内会有哪里他比较喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not seeing much inside this radius that he'd like better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有农场 沼泽地 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, you got farms, you got swamps. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个POI什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}This P.O.I., what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point of interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.17,0:13:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是什么…那里是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it… what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查查看吧 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's find out. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:13:59.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（尼达姆疯人院 1963年废弃）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:02.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（本地疯人院关闭）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尼达姆疯人院\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Needham Asylum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,63年废弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decommissioned in '63.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得像克劳力会喜欢的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound like Crowley's kind of place to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在努力了解世界的一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still learning all you can about the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果无厘头标语\N{\fnArial\fs30}If nonsensical slogans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭配傻逼宠物图片\N{\fnArial\fs30}attached to idiotic pictures of domestic animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.31,0:14:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也算世界的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}counts as the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.22,0:14:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,米姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.85,0:14:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得我的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know to you my rules seem…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不公平 很武断\N{\fnArial\fs30}unfair, arbitrary,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我是有意想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}as though I'm doing all this just to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管你为什么做你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care why you do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望你明白 我没那么坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to know that I'm not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,基维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jervis?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.21,0:15:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能随心所欲地吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have you eating whatever, whenever,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不分时间 食物和多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}however much you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你或许想来点点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might appreciate a little snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续看米姆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you to your memes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:16:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里真是一点底没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what I'm doing here…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.51,0:16:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a bleeding clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.93,0:16:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,每时每刻 怎么能逗你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moment to moment, what makes you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么会惹到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will set you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你建立感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I even begin to forge a connection with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道 你长得飞快\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I do know is you're growing so fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it terrifies me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.22,0:16:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.47,0:16:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留着我 不过是为了我将来能拥有的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only want me for the power I'll wield,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你知道 我很快就不需要你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know, soon enough, I won't need you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真要这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're really gonna do this…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在就去 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now? - Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.83,0:16:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,自锡达拉皮兹市的事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for a chance to get back at Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就一直想找机会报复克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever since that crap he pulled in Cedar Rapids,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其现在我得知他骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially now that I know he tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.59,0:16:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟黑暗一起跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and made off with the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去杀阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going in to kill Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么会没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 我们对她毫不了解 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we don't know the first thing about her, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不了解她有什么本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know her powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.06,0:16:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道怎么除掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know how to take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道她是不是能被杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you know what? We don't even know if she can be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.51,0:16:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她是个太大的威胁 不能再拖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's too big of a threat to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:16:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 我们冲进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,使尽全力攻击她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we hit her with everything we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有很强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have tremendous power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你会拥有更大力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and soon you'll have even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也有你缺的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have something you lack…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,智慧 经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wisdom, experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾帮忙把路西法关进牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped put Lucifer back in his cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在地狱一步步爬上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rose through the ranks of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,击败一切对手 取得了王冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}defeated all comers, to claim the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管曾遭遇几次挫折\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, a few minor setbacks aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还稳坐王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该如何向你传授我所学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to impart what I've learned to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.11,0:17:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.53,0:17:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭你长大这速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at the rate that you're growing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕永远没机会想明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll probably never get the chance to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你不需要我教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you don't need my tutelage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.17,0:18:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我深信\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believe, deep down in my gut,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是有东西可以给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something to offer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你肯给我个机会的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd just give me the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you asking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,再按我的规矩多坚持一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play by my rules for just a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.41,0:18:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me your patience,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.12,0:18:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you my protection…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你认为你再不需要我的保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Until you decide you don't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.13,0:18:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.87,0:18:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝佳的头条啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A night-leader if ever I saw one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.75,0:19:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少能挣五百\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is gonna fetch me $500, minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.12,0:19:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh… I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.02,0:19:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百听起来不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}$500 sounds like plenty,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但考虑到我的开支\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with my overhead…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸也得吃饭啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Daddy's got to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计 你活了 就不是新闻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, buddy. Y-you live, there's no story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾几何时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there was a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要一个弹指\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have brought you back from the brink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能救你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a snap of my fingers…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我未必会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不比从前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not that guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.78,0:20:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.72,0:20:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你找到他的办法一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same way you found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听警用频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scoured the police scanners,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.95,0:20:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶在警察前出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}got ahead of the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,实拍天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, a real-life angel caught on tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.51,0:20:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比随机杀人事件精彩多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is way better than some random homicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:21:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偷了多少东西然后当掉换钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much stuff I had to steal and then pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,才买来那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pay for that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人守卫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No guards at the perimeter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来门口也没有守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like there are no guards at the door, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还觉得我们没找错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is the right place still?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有守护魔符\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…Warding sigils.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,给人类准备了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the humans… look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,中学储物柜用的挂锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}A padlock you'd find on a middle-school locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,自大的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cocky son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.49,0:21:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 外围安保可能比较松懈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, external security may be lax,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.28,0:21:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不知道在里面会遇到多少恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we still don't know how many demons we're gonna face inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就进去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.15,0:22:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻到27页的图谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn to the graph at the bottom of 27,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以看到这三年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll see a nearly 40% decrease.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.51,0:22:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太平洋西北地区灵魂收集\N{\fnArial\fs30}in soul collections in the Pacific Northwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.54,0:22:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,减少近40%\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the past three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是大麻合法化的意外结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unexpected consequence of legalized marijuana?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些分析家是这样认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some analysts think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.93,0:22:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有人不敢确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others are not quite so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:30.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（她为什么对着干 理解你叛逆的青春期女儿）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.23,0:22:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, "Marv"…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.44,0:22:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷兜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're picking pockets,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,见死不救\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving a man to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.71,0:22:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知我以为会是怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I… I don't know what I expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这太让人失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.04,0:22:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好意思说\N{\fnArial\fs30}One to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.44,0:22:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择了工资奴隶的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose the life of a wage slave,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:22:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,打工赚钱 过了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}slinging slurpees for, what, a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是要活出精彩来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am in it to win it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夺走我能量后 我可什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at zero when you took my grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.13,0:23:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲避天使 一文不名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding from angels, not a cent to my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.77,0:23:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我找到了自己的天职\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I found my calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自力更生 改变人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I pulled myself up by my bootstraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.04,0:23:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立了一份生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and started a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.21,0:23:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我的故事才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, my story has only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.25,0:23:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What story is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.38,0:23:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像个秃鹫一样以他人的惨剧为食\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're preying like a vulture on human tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.98,0:23:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活在哪个世纪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What century are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.38,0:23:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗教已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Religion is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.61,0:23:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小说 死得更透\N{\fnArial\fs30}The novel? Deader.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我耻于\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.43,0:23:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠转瞬而逝的视觉冲击挣钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}for dealing in fleeting visual sensation,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.98,0:23:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是恐怖 颓废 堕落的惊鸿一瞥\N{\fnArial\fs30}in gift-length glimpses of horror, waste, and degradation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.06,0:23:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.67,0:23:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是跟上时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just caught up with the times.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.37,0:24:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实是我们这个时代的伟大文学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reality is the great literature of our era,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.49,0:24:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每晚都会去街上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am out there, on the streets,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.71,0:24:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,捕捉现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}every single night, capturing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.73,0:24:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是现实的作者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am reality's author.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.83,0:24:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省你的故事吧 我不是为那个而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, save your story. It is not what I came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.74,0:24:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就直接谈正事喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… straight to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要恶魔石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the demon tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.78,0:24:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是找不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.90,0:24:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分小心地把它藏在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have hidden it very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.26,0:24:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个你和你的朋友们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a place where you and your friends …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.76,0:24:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把石碑藏在你的床垫下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hid it under your mattress.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.54,0:24:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视台把你的地址给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The TV station gave me your address,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你那里搜了一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I-I checked the place out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.10,0:24:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你家有臭虫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize you have bedbugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.14,0:24:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然擅闯我的公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke into my apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对黑暗有什么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about the Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.18,0:25:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是乐队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The band?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.79,0:25:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.85,0:25:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时 深夜写东西时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes during late-night writing sessions,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝喝得烂醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}when God was deep in his cups,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.34,0:25:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能透露过一些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}he may have let slip a few choice words.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.85,0:25:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.95,0:25:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to tell you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.64,0:25:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又健忘了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you forgetting?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.91,0:25:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是人类了 我能把你当虫子一样捏爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are human now, and I could crush you like a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.41,0:25:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是可以 但你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could, but you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.75,0:25:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我没发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I didn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.24,0:25:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坏掉了 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are broken, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.61,0:25:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一向娘里娘气的 但这次呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always a bit of a Nancy, but this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.01,0:25:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直变成了大怂蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have gone full wuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:26:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it was that happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.52,0:26:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但无论怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but whatever it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.81,0:26:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤痕累累 重伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are scarred…deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.75,0:26:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为受伤和恐惧而深感无力\N{\fnArial\fs30}paralyzed by trauma, by fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.10,0:26:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.26,0:26:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连打我都做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't even hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.23,0:26:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.78,0:26:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, idiot, andale …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.72,0:26:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是「赶紧滚过来」的西班牙语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spanish for "Get your ass over here."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.23,0:26:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以为我这五周来一直 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think I've been paying your astronomical bar tabs… - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.01,0:26:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你付天文数字的酒吧账单\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the past five weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.00,0:26:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为让你跟前一晚认识的小骚货一觉睡到大下午吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can sleep past noon with last night's skank?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.86,0:26:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.61,0:26:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.57,0:27:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 你去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.60,0:27:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.93,0:27:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.01,0:27:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.42,0:27:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.38,0:27:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.87,0:27:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我必须要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.62,0:27:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.15,0:27:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家姑娘长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My girl's growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.37,0:27:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该知道要不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have known it wouldn't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.40,0:27:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子们就会来打探\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the boys came sniffing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.21,0:28:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想要跟她做什么 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with her, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你能利用她 控制她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think you can use her, control her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.23,0:28:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.89,0:28:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有想控制她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trying to control her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.13,0:28:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm helping her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.62,0:28:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她实现自己全部的潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to realize her fullest potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.75,0:28:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这让我多烦恼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how disturbing it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.15,0:28:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道自己根本不舍得杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to realize that I couldn't bring myself to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.30,0:28:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年来 我有无数的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had tons of chances over the years,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.66,0:28:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些你根本毫不知情 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}some you don't even know about, but, still…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.30,0:28:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my peace with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.68,0:28:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受我心软的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}embraced my softer side,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.48,0:28:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}learned to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.22,0:28:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我之间的感情实在太复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was just too much going on between you and I …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.98,0:28:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟情谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}bromance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.94,0:28:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.61,0:29:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我今天要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I am gonna kill you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.29,0:29:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉有所不同了 准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel different somehow, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.28,0:29:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.24,0:29:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,父爱能改变一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fatherhood changes a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.26,0:29:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗 你都知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}The Darkness … what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.55,0:29:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.42,0:29:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我判断失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I misjudged.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.49,0:29:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是怕了 你是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not scared. You're mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.90,0:29:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.97,0:29:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那感觉一定很糟吧 被每个人当工具使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it must suck being everyone's tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.06,0:29:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,被天使 被敌人 被朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}manipulated and used by the angels,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.47,0:30:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,操纵和利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}by your enemies, by your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.22,0:30:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为假如你拿回了能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought if you could get your grace back,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.45,0:30:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能治好自己 但并没如愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would help fix you, but it hasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.89,0:30:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.72,0:30:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.88,0:30:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我们达成了共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had an understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.25,0:30:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你保证过要保护我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Your promise to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.75,0:30:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后几小时后 我就在自己房里遭到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, then, hours later, I'm assaulted in my own room.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.21,0:30:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来也并不很生气啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you don't seem terribly upset by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.83,0:30:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.97,0:30:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我不需要你的保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided I don't need your protection,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.03,0:30:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不需要你的禁锢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I certainly don't need your captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.00,0:30:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.84,0:31:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在尝试「不杀」政策吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying out some kind of no-kill policy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.35,0:31:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么愤怒 这么迷失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you have to thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.71,0:31:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是谁的过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}for how angry you are, how lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.20,0:31:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.82,0:31:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.57,0:31:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最该清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You of all people should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.87,0:31:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,反战主义没好果子\N{\fnArial\fs30}pacifism doesn't pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.13,0:32:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧 卡西迪奥 杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, Castiel. End me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.79,0:32:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.78,0:32:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 三个中有俩还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Two out of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.10,0:32:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.43,0:33:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.88,0:33:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在该\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time … time for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.25,0:33:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,秒回你的王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}to blink your tired ass back to your throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.51,0:33:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,舔舐你的伤口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lick your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会饶你一命 但有个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll spare your life on one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.96,0:33:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走之后 放迪恩安全离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe passage for Dean out of here after I've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.47,0:33:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.09,0:33:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.16,0:33:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.97,0:33:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}get out of my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.40,0:34:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.27,0:34:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.72,0:34:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不说自己挺快活的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.04,0:34:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还自力更生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}your "bootstraps."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.22,0:34:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was faking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.07,0:34:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为「能有多难呢」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I thought, "how … how hard could it be?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.44,0:34:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.70,0:34:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.66,0:34:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撑不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't take any more,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.15,0:34:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种凡人生活我一天也过不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a single human day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.33,0:34:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.11,0:34:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种羞辱…根本停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the indignities … they just don't stop …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.45,0:34:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,赚钱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.53,0:34:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,赚钱交房租\N{\fnArial\fs30}making my rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.77,0:34:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不断给手机充电…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keeping my phone charged…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.92,0:35:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还长痔疮\N{\fnArial\fs30}hemorrhoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.17,0:35:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.26,0:35:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了被人摆布利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sick of having my strings pulled,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.18,0:35:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不会让你操纵我\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why I won't let you manipulate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.39,0:35:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你个痛快的了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}into letting you off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.28,0:35:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我关于黑暗的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.68,0:35:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我们之间到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, what is happening here between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.32,0:35:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救我 我救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save me, I save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.32,0:35:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.11,0:35:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被释放后第一眼看到的就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the first thing I saw when I was freed,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.14,0:35:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我被关了好久啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it had been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.83,0:35:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就是因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's it …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.23,0:35:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我看到的第一个他的创造物\N{\fnArial\fs30}my first experience of his creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.98,0:35:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我眼中你不由自主地成了这种代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't help but represent that for me …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.71,0:36:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那美妙的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sweet triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.79,0:36:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及更加美妙的他所锻造的荒唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the even sweeter folly of what he's wrought.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.27,0:36:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法抗拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no fighting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.42,0:36:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被迷住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fascinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.33,0:36:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.86,0:36:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让那些圣经脑残粉三观炸裂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd make the Bible-Thumper's heads explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.10,0:36:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们希望他们的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they want their God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.46,0:36:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹弹手指就能搞定一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be a-a f-finger-snapping,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.02,0:36:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个全能的造物主\N{\fnArial\fs30}all-powerful creator, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.31,0:36:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要…魔法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they want… magic…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.81,0:36:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,波平斯阿姨那样的魔法保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Poppins.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.47,0:36:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他的所作所为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what he did …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.52,0:36:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,造物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}creation…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.59,0:36:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是需要出力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that took work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.38,0:36:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.17,0:36:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了创造世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to create the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.05,0:37:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝只能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}God had to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.95,0:37:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时的唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only thing he'd ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.06,0:37:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不得不背叛 牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had to betray and sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.34,0:37:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他唯一的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}his only kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.42,0:37:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.21,0:37:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}His sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.52,0:37:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴再见到你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been great seeing you again, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.73,0:37:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's time for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.53,0:37:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有整个世界等着我去探索\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a whole world out there for me to explore,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.74,0:37:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直能尝到它的味道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can practically taste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.76,0:37:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 我就将足够强大实现我来这里的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, I'll be strong enough to do what I came here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.33,0:37:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.88,0:37:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,算笔旧账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle an old score …
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.12,0:37:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最古老的旧账\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oldest score.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.16,0:38:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.88,0:38:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 各位 天使妹妹满血复原\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Look, guys, I'm as glad as anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.25,0:38:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和大家一样高兴 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Stella got her groove back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.83,0:38:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你放梅塔特隆走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you let Metatron go?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.19,0:38:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你要重复多少遍这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, how many times are you gonna repeat that question?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.05,0:38:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.74,0:38:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放梅塔特隆走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let Metatron go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.72,0:39:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他哪也去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.58,0:39:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他有动作 如果他引起了丁点的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he makes a move, if he draws the slightest attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.79,0:39:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使军队就会灭了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}the full force of angelkind will snuff him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.60,0:39:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两人都没看见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you … neither of you saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.28,0:39:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个人类 而且非常可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a human, and a pitiable one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.55,0:39:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我们不构成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a threat to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.40,0:39:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真让他很不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, I put him in traction.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.88,0:39:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,二位 现在还有更重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, bigger fish to fry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.89,0:39:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara is in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.99,0:39:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 上帝的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, God's freaking sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.81,0:39:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你就差一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were close.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.11,0:39:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 她是怎么逃走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, how'd she get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.48,0:39:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 「上帝的妹妹」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, what part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.26,0:39:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句话你没听明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"God's freaking sister" did you not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.06,0:39:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比我厉害 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}She overpowered me … end of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.22,0:39:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's our plan here, fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.53,0:39:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你从梅塔特隆那儿套到了一切情报 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you got everything you could out of Metatron, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.75,0:39:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要去那儿找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where on earth are we gonna find an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.29,0:39:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何阻止她的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}on how to stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.36,0:39:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝没分享过他的想法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose God's decided to share any wisdom on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.00,0:39:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去查查传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll look into the lore.
